abrite des volcans actifs, des crevasses profondes et des champs de glace à perte de vue. Cette traversée glaciaire est une immersion totale dans un environnement extrême, façonné par le feu et la glace. Le glacier joue un rôle majeur dans le climat islandais et alimente certaines des plus puissantes rivières du pays. Explorer le Vatnajökull, c’est évoluer au cœur d’un écosystème fragile, spectaculaire et en constante transformation.",[],{"link_type":262,"key":263,"text":264},"Any","5a952a30-606e-44a7-ad18-90fd8406c126","Découvrir",{"dimensions":266,"alt":5,"copyright":5,"url":269,"id":270,"edit":271},{"width":267,"height":268},6000,3376,"https:\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fnico-mathieux\u002FaWOB5QIvOtkhBQzO_IMG_3274.JPG?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=545%2C56%2C5454%2C3069&w=6000&h=3376","aWOB5QIvOtkhBQzO",{"x":272,"y":273,"zoom":274,"background":30},545,56,1.1,"title_text_image$aea1b051-0eba-4589-9c65-6a1e116b7e7e","title_text_image",{"variation":101,"version":102,"items":278,"primary":279,"id":294,"slice_type":295,"slice_label":5},[],{"images":280,"shop_related":18},[281,288],{"image":282,"place":211,"date":287},{"dimensions":283,"alt":5,"copyright":5,"url":284,"id":285,"edit":286},{"width":267,"height":268},"https:\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fnico-mathieux\u002FaWOCAQIvOtkhBQzx_IMG_3474.JPG?auto=format,compress","aWOCAQIvOtkhBQzx",{"x":28,"y":28,"zoom":29,"background":30},"2019-04-08",{"image":289,"place":211,"date":287},{"dimensions":290,"alt":5,"copyright":5,"url":291,"id":292,"edit":293},{"width":267,"height":268},"https:\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fnico-mathieux\u002FaWOCAwIvOtkhBQz1_IMG_3476.JPG?auto=format,compress","aWOCAwIvOtkhBQz1",{"x":28,"y":28,"zoom":29,"background":30},"image_carousel$55ca2ce9-2d09-4951-a911-675ca2b55013","image_carousel",{"variation":101,"version":102,"items":297,"primary":298,"id":311,"slice_type":312,"slice_label":5},[],{"left_image":299,"right_image":306,"shop_related":18},{"dimensions":300,"alt":5,"copyright":5,"